# Bajaj Finance

> Bajaj Finance is one of India's leading and most diversified non-banking financial companies (NBFCs). It offers a wide range of lifecycle financial solutions spanning lending, insurance, investments, asset management, wealth management, consumer durable financing and digital payments — serving 50 million+ customers across India through its website, app, and a vast network of partner stores.

## Loans

- [Personal Loan](https://www.bajajfinserv.in/personal-loan.md): Personal loans from Rs. 40,000 to Rs. 55 lakh at interest rates starting 10% p.a. Tenure 12 months to 108 months. Three variants: Term Loan, Flexi Term Loan (Dropline), and Flexi Hybrid Term Loan. Online application and disbursement within 24 hours*. No collateral and no hidden charges. CIBIL score 650 needed. Processing fee up to 4.13% of loan amount (incl. taxes).

- [Insta Personal Loan](https://www.bajajfinserv.in/insta-personal-loan.md): Insta Personal Loan offering quick access to unsecured funds ranging from Rs. 40,000 to Rs. 15,50,000. Eligible customers can apply online with minimal documentation and receive approval in a few steps, with disbursal in as little as 30 minutes* for select customers, subject to eligibility and verification. Repayment tenures range from 12 months to 96 months. Interest rates range from 16% to 30.5% p.a., with processing fees up to 4.13% of the loan amount (inclusive of applicable taxes). Covers eligibility, documents required, EMI calculator, fees and charges, repayment options, and application process.

- [Home Loan](https://www.bajajfinserv.in/home-loan.md): Home loans up to 30 minutes* for purchasing, constructing, renovating, extending, or buying a residential plot. Interest rates starting from 7.25% p.a.*, repayment tenure up to 40 Years, EMIs starting from Rs. 671/lakh*, and loan approval within 48 hours* for eligible applicants. Balance transfer, top-up, and PMAY subsidy available. Tax benefits under Section 24(b) and 80C.

- [Business Loan](https://www.bajajfinserv.in/business-loan.md): Unsecured business loans from Rs. 1 lakh to 80 lakh for SMEs and self-employed professionals. No collateral required. Flexi Loan option available. Minimum 3 years business vintage, CIBIL score 650. Processing within 48 hours*.

- [Gold Loan](https://www.bajajfinserv.in/gold-loan.md): Gold loans from Rs. 5,000 to Rs. 2 crore against eligible gold jewellery. Interest rates starting from 9.50% p.a., repayment tenure up to 12 months, quick verification and approval, and disbursal in just one branch visit. Includes multiple repayment options, transparent evaluation, part-release facility, gold loan renewal, top-up, no part-prepayment fee or foreclosure fee, gold loan calculator, eligibility, documents, charges, application process, and FAQs.

- [Doctor Loan](https://www.bajajfinserv.in/doctor-loan.md): Doctor loans from Rs. 2 lakh up to Rs. 80 lakh for eligible medical professionals. Interest rates from 11% to 17.50% p.a., no collateral, repayment tenure up to 96 months, 3 unique variants (Term Loan, Flexi Term (Dropline) Loan, and Flexi Hybrid Term Loan), and disbursal in 48 hours*. Includes minimal documentation, end-to-end online application process, eligibility, documents, fees and charges, repayment options, Flexi loan features, and FAQs.

