## Other Languages

All product pages are available in Hindi (हिंदी). To access the Hindi version of any page, prepend `/hindi/` to the path. For example:

- English: `https://www.bajajfinserv.in/personal-loan.md`
- Hindi: `https://www.bajajfinserv.in/hindi/personal-loan.md`

Available language: `hindi`. The Hindi pages carry identical product information, eligibility criteria, interest rates, fees, and application flows as their English counterparts, localised into Hindi. All slugs are the same — only the language prefix changes.
